This subpackage contains Cascadia Mono, a fun, new monospaced font, 
Cascadia Code without ligatures.

For more information have a look at the upstream website: 
https://github.com/microsoft/cascadia-code

Note that upstream has a version with Nerd Font icons: CascadiaMonoNF. 
That has not been created with the Nerd Fonts `font-patcher`.
